A clipped piece ended on the keep-out boundary, which reads as inside, so
each piece without a lead was dropped. A bore-side piece entry fell back to
the unprotected centre region and dived beside the protected item.

Refs #3344

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
